{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanics of this game revolve around size, weight, and portals\u2014along with their many surprising applications. You can push boxes as long as their total size does not exceed your own, meaning that the larger you are, the more and bigger boxes you can push!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8dc452e0815b5b046c8d97dd32f9603e.poster.avif?t=1752570888\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8dc452e0815b5b046c8d97dd32f9603e.webm?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8dc452e0815b5b046c8d97dd32f9603e.mp4?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/fd7675423bcccad1bf798a608ec455f6.poster.avif?t=1752570888\" width=800 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/fd7675423bcccad1bf798a608ec455f6.webm?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/fd7675423bcccad1bf798a608ec455f6.mp4?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, each time you move, you move a distance equal to your own size, making precise positioning more challenging. So, what\u2019s the solution?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you can use something to block your movement?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/c2ed50d17d7304db1629c9197a3ba4de.poster.avif?t=1752570888\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/c2ed50d17d7304db1629c9197a3ba4de.webm?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/c2ed50d17d7304db1629c9197a3ba4de.mp4?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or\u2026 perhaps you can change your size using portals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/d0904471eabab0cd4ea788c2408ffbd9.poster.avif?t=1752570888\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/d0904471eabab0cd4ea788c2408ffbd9.webm?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/d0904471eabab0cd4ea788c2408ffbd9.mp4?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not uncommon to see portals in sokoban-like games, so we've also made some fun features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8143d1d3f83099f571dd6cde1de875ba.poster.avif?t=1752570888\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8143d1d3f83099f571dd6cde1de875ba.webm?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528380/extras/8143d1d3f83099f571dd6cde1de875ba.mp4?t=1752570888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is unique, hoping that you'll find yourself amazed as you solve them. We don\u2019t want you to feel frustrated if you're stuck for too long, so we've left helpful hints for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 chapters and 100 levels, get ready for a puzzling adventure like no other!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u53ea\u53e3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/17e416cfd0717aac8da2c8df6ca9f0627cf900fb.jpg"},{"name":"\u53e3\u7530","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/50250dda95b59892d29dd5258695d4b25a797be6.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ea|\u53e3|","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/5ff737c44e31476fa4895fbeeff287fcab211f5d.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ea\u753b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/ead8e4238d8bde8d406f97ce21ca35126609ad26.jpg"},{"name":"\u53e3||\u53e3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/bfd68ac22a4f8dde293a8dc3b116b6d1e5708b07.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ea\u54c1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/6a973a7aa2b28eefdb0b3504f79719355c314a11.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/17561abaec2ff21f0b0bb9a72ab7f0221da196ad.jpg"},{"name":"\u53e3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/d4ee21b74dfa35d55b4112c2ed325e42ff67292e.jpg"},{"name":"\u5178","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/3d63e37e5ec12f79396fec6a1fa0a405bfe85549.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ea|","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3528380/d057f5b3348288ab4617897471ec7540d8c5aeb7.jpg